        "heritage_title": "Heritage.",
        "heritage_text": "<p>Fifty years of artisanal craftsmanship sit behind every piece. The devotion to Italian craftsmanship that began at Piazza Esquilino 10 continues today from our atelier in New York — the same standard, the same hand, the same line.</p><p>Rome gave us the drawing. New York carries it forward.</p><p>A legacy is not a story told once. It is a line that keeps being drawn.</p>",
        "close_text": "<p>Thank you for carrying it forward.</p>",
